meta {
  name: Catalog
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Catalog writes are currently unprotected. Requests default to auth none.
  Writes and Rate include a disabled Authorization: Bearer {{token}} header.
  Enable that header, or switch the request auth to inherit, to send the token.
  Public GETs stay without auth.
  Rate still 401 until catalog wires OAuth middleware (Phase 6).
}
